": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EeNEtO3prs8Q7kNvwHUHqXq&_nc_oc=AdohBq-OoOhDYmOsI3A6ZmH0eO7ySXM9mg3iPYOsJTkaa4e8uFYPN64YtoVtvnY8JtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKgGtSDaRehI5jk0lK0hYu2T2SRD9Vnpk2G2m3EmzRyYA&oe=6AA01F97"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=20yNhQJJKz8Q7kNvwH76NvO&_nc_oc=Adr6OWqryVoBVaSplG_IFtWtfUJcvfJ5e1iT_ogbJXzNJAmoPJQ5WXmInfAp7jLuE2o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ-RgJrrzGPtrjussBYnlnRZSBWuw11cBh6HgKR7u7PxA&oe=6AA0298B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meWPBvxPFbMQ7kNvwEVtbcP&_nc_oc=AdoPsTuc0Oa8pW_ZOPgR_9ZGmu9Xiv1pufvdf4vWF6SKB5SqWF7ZzN1Td1bHp9z_ryE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLEN4DJhY_w1kzZIryDzBVhC9veyPdxrvPdKtB8qS8Vug&oe=6AA02A8E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uSTGspm_EvAQ7kNvwFVza3Y&_nc_oc=AdpW_0swm5PVQWbjIVz_MCvUh0UFDayoEC4AzfG0xQ8n9oBDCWUQw4aK3QO9NGPdvSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIOSE14l2VTH4LIQfQmfA2Sll9cR39x8lrVuiCCKGKHzQ&oe=6AA013B6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=onZ2sTAv6OEQ7kNvwExIaZ9&_nc_oc=Adq1amZf1Z-NuS6sp3MlDZtWSAFAcrhORL4GMkG-QFJ4fMCMigES0jq60blIyuuQjzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIukrEpcv2T_FzbhIqetWzVynHsfr6b3hSiUCFf4wZb2A&oe=6AA01F94"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OFI2vdMOXSAQ7kNvwGpymUi&_nc_oc=Ado45MkvUkd45fd3dbRUSi6CGLBYwTEzUvrO3hMv4LRpLUtXJQ2SgDNt8V3--dQkX14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLe22NeQ9UcjXMxyk53AQ_Jn1UxdQKAVsZuSVmQ9G1ScA&oe=6A9FFC93"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco